---
// Contact.astro - Sección "Contacto"
---

<section id="contacto" class="section-container scroll-mt-28 border-t border-white/5 !pt-20 !pb-28 md:!pt-28 md:!pb-36">
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start w-full">
    
    <!-- Columna Izquierda: Mensaje y Canales Directos -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-6 relative">
      <!-- Glow decorativo de fondo -->
      <div class="absolute -inset-6 sm:-inset-10 bg-accent-bronze/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>
      
      <!-- Eyebrow Tagline -->
      <span class="text-accent text-xs font-mono tracking-widest uppercase">
        Contacto
      </span>
      
      <!-- H2 Heading -->
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-display font-extrabold text-slate-50 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Conversemos si necesitás transformar datos, finanzas o estrategia en decisiones concretas.
      </h2>
      
      <!-- Descriptive paragraph -->
      <p class="text-muted text-base leading-relaxed">
        Estoy disponible para consultorías especializadas, proyectos integrales de Business Intelligence, modelación macro-financiera y diseño de plataformas analíticas corporativas. Escribime a través de mis canales profesionales oficiales para coordinar una reunión de diagnóstico.
      </p>

      <!-- Botones de Acción Directos -->
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap mt-2 w-full">
        <!-- Correo Electrónico -->
        <a 
          href="mailto:contacto@tomasrau.ar" 
          class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-6 py-4 rounded-lg bg-accent-bronze hover:bg-accent-bronze-hover text-obsidian-bg font-display font-bold text-sm tracking-wide transition-all duration-200 shadow-lg shadow-accent-bronze/10 hover:shadow-accent-bronze/20 active:scale-[0.98] shrink-0"
        >
          <!-- SVG Mail Icon -->
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7"/>
          </svg>
          Enviar Correo
        </a>

        <!-- LinkedIn -->
        <a 
          href="#" 
          class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-6 py-4 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:border-accent-bronze text-slate-200 hover:text-accent-bronze font-display font-bold text-sm tracking-wide transition-all duration-200 glass-surface active:scale-[0.98]"
        >
          <!-- SVG LinkedIn Icon -->
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/>
          </svg>
          LinkedIn
        </a>

        <!-- GitHub -->
        <a 
          href="#" 
          class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-6 py-4 rounded-lg border border-white/10 hover:border-accent-bronze text-slate-200 hover:text-accent-bronze font-display font-bold text-sm tracking-wide transition-all duration-200 glass-surface active:scale-[0.98]"
        >
          <!-- SVG GitHub Icon -->
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"/><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"/>
          </svg>
          GitHub
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Columna Derecha: Tarjetas de Temáticas de Conversación -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 flex flex-col gap-4 w-full">
      <!-- Card 1: Consultoría / Proyectos -->
      <div class="glass-surface p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 shadow-md flex items-start gap-4 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-accent-bronze/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent-bronze/0 group-hover:via-accent-bronze/30 to-transparent transition-all duration-500"></div>
        <div class="p-2 rounded bg-accent-bronze/10 border border-accent-bronze/20 text-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M2 20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16Z"/><path d="M12 17V7"/><path d="M8 11h8"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-100 text-sm tracking-wide">
            Consultoría / proyectos
          </h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Asesoramiento integral y estructuración de modelos analíticos a medida, auditoría de canalizaciones de Business Intelligence y optimización financiera corporativa.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Colaboraciones Profesionales -->
      <div class="glass-surface p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 shadow-md flex items-start gap-4 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-accent-bronze/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent-bronze/0 group-hover:via-accent-bronze/30 to-transparent transition-all duration-500"></div>
        <div class="p-2 rounded bg-accent-bronze/10 border border-accent-bronze/20 text-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-100 text-sm tracking-wide">
            Colaboraciones profesionales
          </h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Co-diseño de plataformas digitales, integración en equipos directivos temporales o estructuración de sinergias operativas basadas en datos y finanzas de mercado.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Contenido, Medios y Speaking -->
      <div class="glass-surface p-5 rounded-xl border border-white/5 shadow-md flex items-start gap-4 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-accent-bronze/20 transition-all duration-300">
        <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-accent-bronze/0 group-hover:via-accent-bronze/30 to-transparent transition-all duration-500"></div>
        <div class="p-2 rounded bg-accent-bronze/10 border border-accent-bronze/20 text-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z"/><path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="19" y2="22"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
          <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-slate-100 text-sm tracking-wide">
            Contenido, medios y speaking
          </h3>
          <p class="text-muted text-xs leading-relaxed">
            Charlas magistrales, paneles técnicos sobre economía, valor del dato corporativo, arquitectura de reportes avanzados e impacto estratégico de la tecnología en la toma de decisiones.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
